Subject: AW: [unmarked] Re: effective open multi-season model by stacking years (so site/years = sites)
Message-ID: <OHkk98y09Zo.EI0GLuGEV1YJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <OHkk98y09Zo.6gRiEowXNeMJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
